# window.trk -- "Window", Headless track 7. 60 BPM, Ab lydian, 4 rows per
# bar (quarter notes), 46 bars.
# Abmaj7#11 | Fm9 | Dbmaj9 | Ebsus, two bars each. The motif C Eb D G is
# four tones of the first chord, so it can float over all of them.

track harm  note cva cvb cvd    # 1  the four Window pad voices
track motif note vel            # 2  Surge Window, through Surge's Nimbus
pattern harm 8x4 harm
1:00 | Ab2 Eb3 G3  D4
3:00 | F2  C3  Eb3 G3
5:00 | Db3 Ab3 C4  Eb4
7:00 | Eb3 Ab3 Bb3 F4

pattern harm_end 6x4 harm
1:00 | Ab2 Eb3 G3  D4
6:00 | off

pattern motif 8x4 motif
1:00 | C5 .7
2:00 | Eb5 .6
3:00 | D5 .6
4:00 | G5 .8
6:00 | off

pattern motif_b 8x4 motif
1:00 | G4 .6
1:02 | C5 .5
3:00 | Eb5 .6
4:00 | D5 .55
5:00 | Bb4 .5
6:02 | C5 .65
8:00 | off

section m  harm+motif
section mb harm+motif_b

order harm*2 m mb harm harm_end
